WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:13.698
嗨！句子合并题会给你两个句子和一个连接词，你要把它们合成一句，而且意思不能改变。今天学几个最常考的。

2
00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:24.762
第一个，although。It was raining. We played outside，合成 Although it was raining, we played outside。不要再加 but。

3
00:00:24.912 --> 00:00:37.074
第二个，so…that。The box was very heavy. I could not lift it，合成 The box was so heavy that I could not lift it。very 要去掉。

4
00:00:37.224 --> 00:00:48.498
第三个，too…to，同样两句可以变成 The box was too heavy for me to lift。注意最后不再写 it。

5
00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:59.226
unless：If you do not hurry, you will be late，变成 Unless you hurry, you will be late。unless 后面不再加 not。

6
00:00:59.376 --> 00:01:07.578
despite：She was ill. She went to school，变成 Despite being ill, she went to school。

7
00:01:07.728 --> 00:01:18.522
neither…nor：Tom cannot swim. Amy cannot swim，变成 Neither Tom nor Amy can swim。cannot 变成 can。

8
00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:26.634
合并完一定要检查：意思和原来一样吗？标点和大写对吗？

9
00:01:26.784 --> 00:01:31.554
小心！Unless you do not study 是错的！

10
00:01:31.704 --> 00:01:39.474
unless 的意思是如果不，已经包含了否定。再加 not，意思就反了。

11
00:01:39.624 --> 00:01:45.570
正确的是 Unless you study, you will fail。

12
00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:59.130
轮到你了！The tea was very hot. I could not drink it，用 too…to 合成一句。暂停一下，想一想。

13
00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:07.698
答案是 The tea was too hot for me to drink。最后不写 it。你答对了吗？

14
00:02:07.848 --> 00:02:20.346
再来一题！Ben was tired. He finished the race，用 Despite 开头。暂停一下，想一想。

15
00:02:20.496 --> 00:02:28.362
答案是 Despite being tired, Ben finished the race。你答对了吗？

16
00:02:28.512 --> 00:02:42.066
第三题！My father does not eat durians. My mother does not eat durians，用 Neither 开头。暂停一下，想一想。

17
00:02:42.216 --> 00:02:53.178
答案是 Neither my father nor my mother eats durians。动词跟着离它近的 my mother，用 eats。你答对了吗？

18
00:02:53.328 --> 00:03:07.482
再加一题！You must wear a helmet. If not, you cannot ride，用 unless 合成一句。暂停一下，想一想。

19
00:03:07.632 --> 00:03:17.250
答案是 You cannot ride unless you wear a helmet。unless 后面不加 not。你答对了吗？

20
00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:32.322
记住：合并句子时，意思一定不能变。although 不加 but，unless 不加 not，too…to 最后不写 it，neither…nor 要把 cannot 变成 can。

21
00:03:32.472 --> 00:03:38.082
试着用 so…that 说一句话吧！

